  "summary": "Filter semantics preserved in all 8 walkers and reduced-stack tests reliably reproduce the spread-argument failure; the one real behavior difference is DFS-to-BFS traversal order, which only matters where consumers sample by position and never changes detection booleans, counts, or filter membership",
  "findings": [
